# Aaris Project original transport aircraft V3 (2026-11-10). Authored specifically for the offline game.
# Saved native mesh: smoothly tapered fuselage, raised empennage, closed airfoil wings, four engine nacelles, curved cockpit glazing.
# Five URP-mapped materials; one static model, four existing shared-mesh rotating propellers. No runtime mesh generation or third-party art.
mtllib CargoPlane.mtl
o Aaris_TacticalTransport_V3
